ına karar verdi.\",\"routeLink\":\"ekonomi/cin-ve-tayland-menseli-bazi-bebek-urunlerinin-ithalatinda-dampinge-karsi-onlemler-surecek/4138163\",\"imageUrl\":\"328f0a69900644c2e8e57ab3bba1fab2.jpg\",\"archive\":false,\"videoUrl\":null,\"videoTime\":null,\"author\":null,\"authorImageUrl\":\"\",\"authorId\":null,\"authorTitle\":null,\"authorUrl\":\"\",\"poster\":null,\"filePath\":\"Contents/2026/11/26\",\"headline\":null,\"slot\":null,\"showAtLastNews\":1,\"createDate\":\"2026-11-26T08:40:19.683\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-11-26T08:41:09.04\",\"contentPhotos\":[],\"contentVideos\":[],\"id\":4138163,\"imagePath\":\"https://web-cdnprod.aa.com.tr/uploads/Contents/2026/11/26/\",\"videoPath\":\"\",\"posterPath\":\"\",\"posterUrl\":\"\",\"formatedCreatedDate\":\"26 Kasım 2026\",\"formatedUpdatedDate\":\"\",\"fullRoute\":\"/tr/ekonomi/cin-ve-tayland-menseli-bazi-bebek-urunlerinin-ithalatinda-dampinge-karsi-onlemler-surecek/4138163\",\"timeDifference\":\"\",\"isRecent\":false,\"newsType\":1},{\"enmNewsType\":0,\"liveBlogId\":null,\"liveBlogIsActive\":null,\"contentId\":4138157,\"redirect\":\"\",\"title\":\"Başkentteki FETÖ operasyonunda 3 firari yakalandı\",\"subTitle\":\"Başkentteki FETÖ operasyonunda 3 firari yakalandı\",\"description\":\"Başkentte polisin Fetullahçı Terör Örgütü'ne (FETÖ) yönelik operasyonunda 3 firari yakalandı.\",\"routeLink\":\"gundem/baskentteki-feto-operasyonunda-3-firari-yakalandi/4138157\",\"imageUrl\":\"493ab11fb6a4474f83c5ec156a302388.jpg\",\"archive\":false,\"videoUrl\":null,\"videoTime\":null,\"author\":null,\"authorImageUrl\":\"\",\"authorId\":null,\"authorTitle\":null,\"authorUrl\":\"\",\"poster\":null,\"filePath\":\"Contents/2026/11/26\",\"headline\":null,\"slot\":null,\"showAtLastNews\":1,\"createDate\":\"2026-11-26T08:10:11.827\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-11-26T08:10:52.903\",\"contentPhotos\":[],\"contentVideos\":[],\"id\":4138157,\"imagePath\":\"https://web-cdnprod.aa.com.tr/uploads/Contents/2026/11/26/\",\"videoPath\":\"\",\"posterPath\":\"\",\"